@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-author-or-admin-access-token
@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Soft-delete a recipe owned by the authenticated author (or as Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A recipe ID that does not exist returns 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
